Name: Chromium depot_tools (gclient, gn, autoninja, git-cl, cipd, repo)
Short Name: depot_tools
URL: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/tools/depot_tools
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Version: 2026.11.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Google's official build and source management toolkit for Chromium, ChromiumOS, V8, Skia, Dawn, and Angle.
Includes gclient, gn, autoninja, git-cl, cipd, fetch, and cros_sdk workflows.

Local Modifications:
- Wrapped by native Bun toolkit in yolo-bun (yolo-bun:depot-tools) and C:/src/google/devtools/depot-tools.
- Bridges directly to local C:/src/depot_tools and C:/src/chromium/src without Python wrapper overhead where possible.
